Tax Coding Identification  

Interface Control Document (ICD) 

Overview 

This document describes the required sample input and output formats for the Tax Coding use case pipeline. The pipeline automates the decision-making process for identifying tax codes for invoice line items using the information available. This pipeline will work post the rule-based tax coding identification process in AP Advance layer, and the input and output samples gives information of the JSON input format and output format for the LLM layer respectively. The tax codes will be identified based on the filtered tax master data and filtered historical data that will be passed to the LLM layer along with the invoice headers and lines. The filtering of the tax master data and the historical data will be done at the AP Advance layer. 

